Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.12,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Rome put a {\c&H006DDCFF&}dead{\r} pope
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.12,0:00:02.01,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}on trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.01,0:00:02.89,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Imagine dying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.89,0:00:03.77,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}and {\c&H006DDCFF&}still{\r} having to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.77,0:00:05.08,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}attend this fucking meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:06.08,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}In the year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:07.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}eight {\c&H006DDCFF&}nine{\r}ty-seven,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:07.76,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Pope Stephen the Sixth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.76,0:00:08.73,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}had Pope Formosus
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.73,0:00:09.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}dug up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.50,0:00:10.23,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}He'd been buried
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.23,0:00:11.34,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}about {\c&H006DDCFF&}nine{\r} months.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.47,0:00:12.23,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}They dressed him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.23,0:00:13.15,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}in papal robes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.15,0:00:13.67,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}and sat him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.67,0:00:14.30,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}in court.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:15.71,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Strict dress code.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.71,0:00:16.78,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Pulse optional.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:18.76,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Stephen asked the questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.76,0:00:19.68,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}A {\c&H006DDCFF&}deacon{\r} answered
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:20.67,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}for the corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.67,0:00:21.56,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Imagine coaching
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:22.42,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}the poor bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:23.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}on eye contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:24.59,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}The charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.59,0:00:26.73,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs60}Taking the papal throne illegally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.73,0:00:28.53,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}The verdict? Guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.53,0:00:29.57,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}No shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.57,0:00:30.39,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Look who'd already
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.39,0:00:31.77,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}moved into his office.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.89,0:00:32.71,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}They annulled
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.71,0:00:33.90,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}his official acts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:35.41,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Imagine getting ordained,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.41,0:00:36.11,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}then finding out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.11,0:00:36.93,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}you're just some prick
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.93,0:00:38.29,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}with excellent sleeves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.29,0:00:39.36,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}And who’d made
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.36,0:00:40.22,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Stephen a bishop?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.22,0:00:41.60,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}The fucking {\c&H006DDCFF&}defendant{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.73,0:00:42.93,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Later that year,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:44.40,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}the ruling was overturned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.75,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Same {\c&H006DDCFF&}defendant{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.75,0:00:47.07,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Opposite verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.07,0:00:47.97,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}And his entire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.97,0:00:49.22,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}legal strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:50.54,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Sit fucking {\c&H006DDCFF&}still{\r}.
